%% ============================================
%% FRONTISPIECE — "全書一句話"
%% ============================================
\thispagestyle{empty}
\begin{center}
\vspace*{0.3in}

\begin{tikzpicture}
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (-2.8,0) -- (-0.55,0);
  \fill[ScriptureGold] (0,0) circle (0.055);
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (0.55,0) -- (2.8,0);
\end{tikzpicture}

\vspace{0.22cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{ChapterBlue} 全書一句話 \textperiodcentered\ The Whole Story in One Verse}

\vspace{0.30cm}
\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\centering\vspace{0.2cm}
\normalsize\color{CommentaryBrown}
我要作他的父，他要作我的子。我必不像從掃羅身上撤去恩典那樣從他身上撤去，\\
卻要讓他長久立在我家中和我的國裡，他的寶座也必\textbf{\color{RoyalRed}堅定}，直到永遠。\\[0.5em]
\footnotesize\itshape
I will be to him a father, and he shall be to me a son. I will not take my steadfast\\
love from him... but I will confirm him in my house and in my kingdom forever,\\
and his throne shall be \textbf{established} forever.\\[0.4em]
\small\color{ChapterBlue} 歷代志上 17:13-14 \textperiodcentered\ 1 Chronicles 17:13-14
\vspace{0.2cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.35cm}
{\small\color{TextGray} 一句應許 \textperiodcentered\ 三個部分 \textperiodcentered\ 一卷書的重量\\
\textit{One promise \textperiodcentered\ three parts \textperiodcentered\ the weight of one book}}

\vspace{0.30cm}
{\small
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{2.6cm}p{2.2cm}p{4.2cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{部分} & \textbf{章節} & \textbf{在全書的展開} \\
\midrule
家譜 & 1-9章 & 神從未失去對你的追蹤——從亞當直到被擄歸回，一個名字都沒有少 \\
大衛興起與約櫃入城 & 10-16章 & 神的同在被迎回——從掃羅的死亡到約櫃安放帳幕 \\
大衛之約與聖殿籌備 & 17-29章 & 神的永遠應許，與大衛最偉大的遺產——他永遠見不到的工程 \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{ChapterBlue} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
不是來讀一份名單、一堆建殿的材料清單，是來認出：神從未弄丟任何一個名字，\\
也從未輕看任何一件你今生看不到完成、卻仍然全力預備的工作。\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
You are not just reading a list of names and building materials — you are
learning that God has never lost track of a single name, and never despises
work you prepare in full but will not live to see finished.}
\end{minipage}

\vfill
{\scriptsize\color{LightGray} PubHub 三書精讀系統 \textperiodcentered\ Soli Deo Gloria}

\vspace{0.3in}
\end{center}
